# The Makefile is in git: it uses relative paths, and a fresh checkout needs it to
# build the library before the tests run. Regenerate it with the command in its header
# whenever a source file is added or removed.
# makefrag is in git as well: it holds the compiler flags of the library.
# generated / machine-specific build artifacts
out/
*.so
*_m.cc
*_m.h
